Package: lmcc
Title: The Language Model Calling Convention
Version: 0.8.6
Authors@R: person("Maxime", "Rivest", email = "mrive052@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Lays out a call to a language model and reads the reply back:
    where each argument goes, how the result comes back, how each type
    crosses. A typed signature and an adapter (a template, a reader,
    transports by purpose, formats by type) bind into a plan that renders
    requests in the 'lm15' canonical form and parses replies, refusing by
    name before any request is sent. Implements the same contract as the
    'Python', 'TypeScript' and 'Julia' kernels, byte for byte.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
URL: https://github.com/MaximeRivest/lmcc
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: lm15, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
NeedsCompilation: yes
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
